THE TOILET DREAM — THE ULTIMATE BETRAYAL — third-party material

MUSIC
- Original score composed for this film (theme, variations, stings, final chord, the last note). Written as note events in mix.py.
- Performed with samples: Piano: "Salamander Grand Piano V3" by Alexander Holm, licensed under CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/)

SOUND EFFECTS
- All foley and room tones (footsteps, blanket, mattress creaks, breathing, gasps, heartbeat, cheek taps, light switch,
  toilet lid, water stream, crickets) are synthesised in mix.py with the Lemo-Opuscar foley helpers (MIT). No recorded or stock sounds.

VOICE
- None. The film has no dialogue, narration or text.

PICTURE
- Every frame is drawn by the code in src/ (Canvas 2D) in the owner's own "Golden Hour Stickman" style
  (my-styles/golden-hour-stickman), captured with Playwright / Chromium and encoded with ffmpeg. No generated or stock images.
- Rendering toolkit: Lemo-Opuscar core tools (MIT).
